# VHS Tape for fitcheck demo
# Run with: vhs demo.tape

Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800
Set TypingSpeed 100ms
Set Theme "Dracula"

# Start in the workspace
Type "fitcheck ."
Sleep 1s
Enter

# Give the audience time to read the awesome output
Sleep 4s

# Run diff command to show off the other cool feature
Type "fitcheck diff"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
